## 11. Architecture Summary

The Azure‑centric serverless architecture was chosen because it delivers rapid development, automatic scaling, and aligns with the client’s preference for Azure while keeping operational costs low. Managed services such as Azure OpenAI, Azure AD B2C, and Azure SQL provide the required AI capabilities, secure authentication, and data persistence without extensive infrastructure management. This design satisfies functional needs for real‑time role‑play, scoring, and reporting, and meets non‑functional goals of performance, security, and scalability, while preserving IP for future white‑label expansion across partner accounts.
